  iti śrīmad-bhāgavate mahā-purāṇe brahma-sūtra-bhāṣye

 pāramahaṃsyaṃ saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ

  daśama-skandhe rāsa-krīḍā-varṇanaṃ

