|| 10.31.8 ||

  madhurayā girā valgu-vākyayā

budha-mano-jñayā puṣkarekṣaṇa |

 vidhi-karīr imā vīra muhyatīr

adhara-sīdhunāpyāyayasva naḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : he puṣkarekṣaṇa, tavaiva madhurayā girā valgūni vākyāni yasyāṃ
tayā budhānāṃ manojñayā hṛdyayā gambhīrayety arthaḥ | muhyatīr imā no
vidhikarīḥ kiṃkarīr adharasīdhunā āpyāyayasva saṃjīvayeti ||8 ||

vaṃśīdharaḥ :

caitanya-mañjuṣā : na vyākhyātam |

