yaṃ ^ manyeran nabhas tāvad vimāna-śata-saṅkulam |

  divaukasāṃ sa-dārāṇām autsukyāpahṛtātmanām ||

śrīdharaḥ : tāvat tat-kṣaṇam evautsukya-vyāpta-manasāṃ sa-strīkāṇāṃ
devānāṃ vimāna-śataiḥ saṅkulaṃ saṅkīrṇaṃ nabho babhūva ||4||

vaṃśīdharaḥ :

caitanya-mata-mañjuṣā :

vaiṣṇava-toṣaṇī :

