asahamānena tena sva-dorbhyāṃ gṛhītaḥ kaṇṭho yāsāṃ tādṛśya ity arthaḥ
||15||

bṛhat-krama-sandarbhaḥ : atha kṣaṇaṃ viśramya punar vihāram ārebhire ity
