ekānta-vallabham atidayitaṃ kāntaṃ kamanīyam acyutaṃ labdhvā tad-dorbhyām
acyuta-bhujābhyāṃ gṛhīta-kaṇṭhyaḥ satyas taṃ gāyantyas tat-kṣaṇa-kṛtena
