 tābhir yutaḥ śramam apohitum aṅga-saṅga- |

ghṛṣṭa-srajaḥ sa kuca-kuṅkuma-rañjitāyāḥ ||

  gandharva-pālibhir anudruta āviśad vāḥ |

śrānto gajībhir ibha-rāḍ iva bhinna-setuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : atha jalakelim āha—tābhir iti | tāsām aṅga-saṅgena ghṛṣṭā
saṃmarditā yā srak tasyāḥ ata eva tāsāṃ kuca-kuṅkumena rañjitāyāḥ
sambandhibhir gandharva-pālibhir gandharvapā gandharva-pataya iva gāyanto
yo'layas tair anudruto'nugataḥ sa kṛṣṇo vāḥ udakam āviśat | bhinna-setur
vidārita vapraḥ svayaṃ cātikrānta-loka-veda-maryādaḥ ||23||

vaṃśīdharaḥ :

caitanya-mata-mañjuṣā :

vaiṣṇava-toṣaṇī :

bṛhad-vaiṣṇava-toṣaṇī :

