cedam adharma-mātraṃ kalañja-bhakṣaṇādivat kintu mahā-sāhasam ity
āha—para-dārābhimarśanam iti ||28||

vaṃśīdharaḥ :

caitanya-mata-mañjuṣā : kathaṃ pratīpam ācaret ? tad eva kim ?
tatrāha—para-dāra-vimarśanam ||28||

